Quiet settled flight still paid wanted-ring / customs-weir / route-ribbon /
payload-ghost truth readers + mesh hide writes every tick while all four
were inactive. Latch after first empty observe; wake on cheap identity/ref
snapshot (heatZone flags, customsWeir ref, nav/autopilot/waypoint/target,
tether phase/targetId, payloadReleaseGhost ref) — not a full truth re-read.
Different angle from held truth-reread wake. Soft-GPU fps not claimed.
Picture unchanged.
